    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 8,
    "summary": "A messianic psalm of David—He says that babes and children praise the Lord—He asks, What is man, that Thou art mindful of him?",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "O Lord our Lord, how excellent is thy name in all the earth! who hast set thy glory above the heavens.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 33
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Out of the mouth of babes and sucklings hast thou ordained strength because of thine enemies, that thou mightest still the enemy and the avenger.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "TG Children."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "When I consider thy heavens, the work of thy fingers, the moon and the stars, which thou hast ordained;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "TG Beauty."
          },
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "TG Heaven."
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "TG God, Works of."
          },
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "TG Astronomy."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "What is man, that thou art mindful of him? and the son of man, that thou visitest him?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 11,
            "text": "Job 7:17 (17–18); Ps. 144:3 (1–15); Heb. 2:6 (6–8). TG Mortality."
          },
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 81,
            "text": "1 Ne. 2:16; 19:11; Alma 17:10; D&C 5:16."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For thou hast made him a little lower than the angels, and hast crowned him with glory and honour.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "HEB less than the gods."
          },
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 53,
            "text": "TG Man, Potential to Become like Heavenly Father; Worth of Souls."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou madest him to have dominion over the works of thy hands; thou hast put all things under his feet:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 32,
            "text": "TG Man, Potential to Become like Heavenly Father."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 86
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "All sheep and oxen, yea, and the beasts of the field;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 9,
            "text": "TG Sheep."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The fowl of the air, and the fish of the sea, and whatsoever passeth through the paths of the seas.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 60
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "O Lord our Lord, how excellent is thy name in all the earth!",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 33
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
